module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.unresolved_callee_conflated_with_dispatched_elsewhere

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data unresolved_callee_conflated_with_dispatched_elsewhere: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "unresolved_callee_conflated_with_dispatched_elsewhere" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**one unresolved-callee state carries both ANSWERED BY ANOTHER DISPATCH PATH and DECLARED SOMEWHERE BUT UNREACHABLE FROM HERE, so the second can never refuse -- and a deletion census built on loud refusal undercounts by the ratio of the two** (INVALID STATE: a call whose callee does not resolve at the direct-call seam produces NO diagnostic, because the same state is reached routinely and legitimately by names another path answers -- pipeline and collection methods, variant constructors. The consumer therefore treats the state as non-fatal for every member. A callee that is genuinely unreachable is then indistinguishable from one that is about to be dispatched elsewhere, and the program continues with a type derived from the callee's own name. ",

    "HARM, AND IT IS NOT PRIMARILY THE MISSING DIAGNOSTIC. A delete-first replacement migration rests on the premise that removing an authority makes every real dependent REFUSE LOUDLY, so that what breaks IS the census. A seam that declines to refuse silently voids that premise: the population that surfaces is not the population that broke, it is the subset something downstream happened to COMPARE. The migration is then sized, prioritized and declared complete against a number that is wrong by construction, and the remainder stays invisible precisely because nothing failed. ",

    "MEASURED 2026-09-06 (import-deletion lane, namespace cut NS-N) by instrumenting the construction of `CallTargetOutcome::CallableUnresolved` in `v1.compiler.infer` `call_target_for_direct_call` and compiling the two-root corpus `--source-root src/v1 --source-root dag` on both arms. MAIN (1ae1802778): 1132 events, 148 (module, callee) pairs, 27 distinct callees, 0 blocking diagnostics. THE CUT BRANCH: 1365 events, 252 pairs, 100 distinct callees, 6 blocking diagnostics. Main-only is EMPTY -- the branch set is a strict superset -- and the 104 branch-only pairs carry 73 distinct callees. ",

    "**THE PARTITION IS CATEGORICAL RATHER THAN A MATTER OF DEGREE, AND IT IS WHAT MAKES THE CLASS DECIDABLE.** Of main's 27 callees, ZERO are declared as `fn` anywhere in the corpus: they are `map`, `fold`, `filter`, `any`, `all`, `first`, `last`, `skip`, `split`, `join`, `chars`, `contains`, `enumerate`, `flat_map`, `empty_map`, and the constructors `Fnv1a64`, `Sha1Hash`/`Sha256Hash`/`Sha512Hash`, `OciSha256Digest`/`OciSha512Digest`/`OciOtherDigest`, `UriHexNibbleConstructed`/`UriPercentComponentEncoded`/`UriUnicodeScalarConstructed`/`UriUtf8OctetConstructed`/`UriValidatedScalarConstructed`. Of the 73 branch-only callees, 73 OF 73 SHARE A LEAF NAME WITH SOME `fn` DECLARATION in the pool. **THE MEASURE IS DECLARED-LEAF CORRELATION AND NOT ENTITLEMENT, AND AN EARLIER REVISION OF THIS ROW OVERCLAIMED IT.** It establishes that the cut introduced declared-leaf-correlated unresolved callees under the two-root completed subject. HELD DECLARED-LEAF-CORRELATED POPULATION: 85 distinct callees at the `global_bare` grain, 73 at the `^fn` grain -- different questions, neither correcting the other, and the grain must be named wherever either figure appears. **THE MIGRATION POPULATION REMAINS PENDING THE OCCURRENCE-TO-CONTAINMENT-PROVIDER JOIN AND IS NOT ANY OF THESE NUMBERS.** Calling the correlated set the migration set would assert that being declared somewhere means it should resolve here, which is the withdrawn wall returning as a denominator instead of a rule -- the harder form to notice, because nobody argues with a number. Some of the 85 are exactly the constructor and builtin-adjacent cases whose downstream channel is supposed to answer. It does NOT establish that those calls are ENTITLED to those declarations, which needs the containment join, and it does NOT license a predicate: a wall of the form "unresolved AND some declaration shares this leaf" was proposed on the strength of this partition and WITHDRAWN, because it makes corpus population into naming input -- an unrelated sibling declaration could turn a legitimately continuing call into a refusal while being unable to make it resolvable, which is the falsifier `CallableOwnerIndex` already records at 39 rebound `contains` sites. The 0-of-27 exonerates today's main under this subject; it is not a law that builtin-adjacent and declared names are disjoint, and `v1.compiler.lookup` already carries machinery deciding whether a declared callable and a builtin are the same modelled authority or rivals. ",

    "POSITIVE CONTROL, PASSING IN BOTH DIRECTIONS, which is what licenses the reading of the 67 sites that emit nothing. PRESENT, as required: `cost_constant`, `empty_complexity_report`, `gunbc_cli_generated_dispatch_subcommands` -- the three callees whose failure IS visible, each surfacing as a downstream type incompatibility rather than as a resolution refusal. ABSENT, as required: `run_complexity_analysis` (declared in the SAME module as its call site and resolving correctly), `typecheck`, `build_type_env`, `realize_module`. Also absent, and this is the sharpest control because it was not predicted: `cost_poly`, which the corresponding diagnostic shows DID resolve. The instrument agrees with the six on the six. ",

    "THE VISIBLE THREE SHOW THE MECHANISM: an unresolved callee yields a type named after the callee -- `Primitive(cost_constant)`, `Primitive(empty_complexity_report)`, `Node(gunbc_cli_generated_dispatch_subcommands<...>)` -- and the compile fails only where a later construction COMPARES that type against another, in these cases the two branches of an `if` and a method lookup on the fabricated receiver. Two of the six reported diagnostics are the two branches of one `if`, so the six diagnostics are five sites. FIVE VISIBLE SITES AGAINST 104. ",

    "SCOPE NOT CLAIMED, because the decision does not turn on it and the measurement does not settle it: three of the 73 are shown to fabricate a name-derived type by their own diagnostics; the other 70 emit nothing while the corpus still compiles, which is consistent BOTH with fabrication-then-silence and with a later fallback resolving some of them. The resulting type was not captured, so the two are not separated here. What is established either way is that 73 declared callees reach the unresolved state on the branch and 27 do on main, and that every one of the additional 73 is declared. ",

    "**THE ABSORBER IS NOT THIS CONSTRUCTOR AND AN EARLIER REVISION LOOKED AT THE WRONG SEAM.** `CallableUnresolved` legitimately means the direct classifier did not provide the final answer, which is what the main-side 27 -- methods, builtins, variant constructors -- empirically confirm. The fabrication happens in the ExprCall TAIL, after the method bridge, special/kernel, registered builtin, function-valued local and variant-constructor paths have all legitimately missed: the tail calls `lookup_type_by_name`, which does NOT establish that the binding it finds is a TYPE declaration -- it asks `lookup_binding_by_name` and accepts a node that merely declares the same spelling. So A FUNCTION DECLARATION IS ACCEPTED AS EVIDENCE FOR A TYPE-CONSTRUCTOR RESULT, which is `Primitive(cost_constant)` exactly. A second absorber sits beside it: `global_bare_callable_node` treats a suitably shaped node from `lookup_binding_by_name` as callable, and that falls through to the whole-pool `global_bare_lookup` -- the same authoritative fallback that `func_sig_from_global_bare` states in capitals NO LONGER ANSWERS A BARE CALLABLE NAME AND REFUSES. The authority was deleted at one site and a hand-written equivalent survived later in the same file. **AND THE REFUSAL IS ALREADY WRITTEN:** the tail's own `function '<name>' not found in scope` is reachable only once both absorbers miss, so the repair is to stop two things from suppressing an existing wall rather than to build a new one. ",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: outside the ladder for the census question -- the deletion program's completeness measure silently reports a subset as the population, which is DESIGN section 5 silent wrongness rather than a low rung. The diagnostic that DOES fire is honest where it fires; nothing about the visible five is wrong. ",

    "CEILING: structurally guaranteed, and reachable now rather than after a grounding. The state is already partitioned -- `CallTargetOutcome` carries `CallableUnresolved` as its own constructor -- and whether a callee is declared in the corpus is decided by the same declaration index the compiler already builds. The remaining work is that the CONSUMER treats the constructor as non-fatal for every member: `declared_formal_authority_failed` is false for `CallableUnresolved`, so the refusal reason is computed and never emitted. ",

    "NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, naming the capability, and stated at the seam that actually absorbs rather than the one that merely reports: A CALL REACHING THE ExprCall TAIL WITH NO ESTABLISHED TARGET REFUSES WITH THE LOCATED `function not found in scope` DIAGNOSTIC THAT IS ALREADY WRITTEN THERE, which requires that the type-constructor path accept only evidence STRUCTURALLY ESTABLISHING a callable type or data constructor -- the declaration kind the compiler already carries, never `a binding answered` -- and that the bare whole-pool callable fallback be removed from the tail's production path, leaving qualified exact-identity resolution where its exact-path authority supports it. A SEPARATE AND CONSTRUCTION-GRADE ARM IS ADMITTED BESIDE IT: an exact reference-resolution authority saying THIS occurrence binds THIS declaration, with the carrier that must hold it not holding it, refuses immediately as an internal invariant defect -- the analogue of `LocallyBoundBindingMissing`, and independent of pool population, which is exactly what the withdrawn leaf-name predicate was not. THREE CONTROLS GATE THE CONSTRUCTION: an OFF-CHAIN HOMONYM (a bare call outside a sibling declaration's containment behaves IDENTICALLY with and without that declaration present), a BUILTIN/DECLARATION COLLISION (a legitimate builtin path does not begin refusing because a same-spelled declaration exists elsewhere), and an ACTUAL TYPE OR DATA CONSTRUCTOR still succeeding after the narrowing, without which fabrication has merely been traded for over-refusal. A census instrument, a count, or a one-off migration of the known sites does NOT fire this trigger -- they size a population rather than prevent the state, and the whole content of this row is that a population sized by what happened to fail is the wrong number. ",

    "**THE STRONGEST RECEIPT FOR THIS CLASS IS THAT IT RECURRED IN THE INSTRUMENT BUILT TO MEASURE IT, AUTHORED BY THE PERSON WHO FILED THIS ROW, HOURS AFTER FILING IT.** `DirectCallClassifierUnresolved` was added as an advisory census at this same seam and emitted ZERO times over the whole corpus. A region-entry marker measured the site reached 21017 times -- 15581 DeclaredCallableResolved, 3961 BuiltinCallableResolved, 1365 CallableUnresolved (exactly the construction-site count), 110 LocallyBoundCallee -- so the diagnostic list was BUILT 1365 times and DISCARDED, because it was threaded into two result assemblies that are not the ones returned on the path that outcome takes. The instrument reproduced the invalid state it was written to observe. ",

    "**THAT RECURRENCE IS WHY THIS IS STRUCTURAL RATHER THAN INCIDENTAL, AND IT IS THE PART A FUTURE READER SHOULD TAKE.** An author who has just written down the class, is looking directly at it, and is building the tool to count it, still discards a value at this seam -- so the seam makes discarding EASY FOR ANYONE, and no amount of care is the remedy. THE DURABLE REPAIR IS THEREFORE NOT BETTER WIRING BUT MAKING THE DISCARD UNREPRESENTABLE: the seam returns its diagnostics AS PART OF ITS RESULT rather than as a side value a caller must remember to thread into the correct assembly, exactly as deleting an accumulator field made incremental publication unwritable rather than merely absent. The interim repair binds the whole call arm to one result and attaches the diagnostics to it once, so every return path carries them and none can be forgotten; the structural form -- the seam owning its own diagnostics -- is the next-rung candidate. ",

    "AND A SECOND RECEIPT FROM THE SAME CHANGE, RECORDED BECAUSE IT IS THE BENEFIT SIDE OF A COST THIS LEDGER OTHERWISE ONLY CHARGES FOR: adding the variant REFUSED TO COMPILE at two hand-written exhaustive matches over `CompilerDiagnostic` in `cli_run/compile_clean.rs`, and the refusals named themselves. That is the several-independent-total-matches-over-one-coproduct class stopping the line loudly instead of defaulting a new variant through a wildcard. The class costs an author two edits per variant and it is what prevented a silent misclassification here. ",

    "**THE EVENT-COUNT GAP IS RESOLVED AND IT IS NOT A LOST DIAGNOSTIC.** The instrument attaches 1365 times and renders 1349, and the missing 16 were first read as evidence of a second path to the outcome that bypassed the attachment. Executed, that is false: an entry marker and an attachment marker both count 1365, so every occurrence reaches the attachment. Adding the SPAN to the key settles it -- 1365 attach events carry 1349 DISTINCT (module, callee, span) triples, duplicates exactly 16. Sixteen call sites are inferred TWICE at the same span and their identical diagnostics collapse on render. The sites are named: 15 `empty_map` (8 in v1.compiler.infer, 4 in v1.compiler.complexity, one each in emit_rust, infer_env and resolve) and one `join` in extdeps.uri. So the RENDERED count is the distinct-site count and the ATTACH count is inflated by re-inference; the identity set is unaffected in either direction. The residue is a small DUPLICATED-WORK observation -- sixteen call sites inferred twice -- and not a dropped-refusal one. ",

    "WHICH EDGE EACH PIECE OF EVIDENCE EXERCISES, STATED SEPARATELY BECAUSE A CONTROL CANNOT ESTABLISH PRODUCER-TO-CONSUMER WIRING IF IT CONSTRUCTS THE CONSUMER''S INPUT INDEPENDENTLY OF THE PRODUCER. (a) THE OUTCOME-DISCRIMINATION EDGE is exercised by the structural control: the attachment point is reached 21017 times across all outcomes and emits only for `CallableUnresolved`, so 15581 `DeclaredCallableResolved` and 3961 `BuiltinCallableResolved` calls produce nothing -- a probe that flagged everything would read 21017. That control says nothing about whether emissions reach the output. (b) THE PRODUCER-TO-RENDERER EDGE is exercised by the advisory total moving 8549 to 9898, a delta of exactly 1349 matching the emission count, which no hand-built fixture manufactures. (c) THE MUTATION DISCRIMINATOR WAS RUN, AND NOT ON PURPOSE: the first wiring of this instrument threaded the diagnostics into two result assemblies the unresolved path does not return through, and it rendered ZERO while still compiling clean and still computing the list 1365 times. Producer disconnected, output zero; producer connected, output 1349. That is the edge established by execution rather than by shape, and it is why compiling unchanged is not evidence -- an inert instrument compiles unchanged too. ",

    "RECOGNITION RULE: when a deletion program reports its remaining work as a count of diagnostics, ask what the compiler DOES with the failure state the deletion produces -- not how many diagnostics appeared. If the state is reached legitimately by any population, the consumer will have been written to tolerate it, and tolerance is indistinguishable from correctness at every call site that nothing downstream inspects. The tell is a failure constructor whose consumer computes a refusal reason and then does not use it. ",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
